{"version":1,"content":"<p>Mozilla Firefox 160.0正式版發佈。這是該瀏覽器按照雙周更新節奏推出的最新穩定版本。本次更新帶來了多項實用功能，其中最值得關注的是新增設備端實時語音識別能力，以及擴展了Matroska（MKV）視頻容器的音頻格式支持範圍。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585696.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.162506+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:42:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"d8265041744175efd61480d6c3a58ec692b4f777203299d383b226304827b53a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}